  "prefLabel": "Res 5302.08 Time Period for Extension of the 180 Day Period for Land Conversions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5302.08 Time Period for Extension of the 180 Day Period for Land Conversions. Approval from the director to extend the 180 day period for changes in land use shall be valid for up to 270 days from the original completion date of the cutting operation.\n\nSource. #8441, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10547, eff 3-21-14 (from Res 5302.09)",
